 of the best examples of that genre in Russian literature.","facts":{"born":"1812-03-25","died":"1870-01-09"},"rel":{"Citizenship":[["Q34266","Russian Empire"],["Q39","Switzerland"],["Q142","France"]],"Occupation":[["Q4964182","philosopher"],["Q36180","writer"],["Q1930187","journalist"],["Q18814623","autobiographer"],["Q4263842","literary critic"],["Q12144794","prose writer"],["Q6051619","opinion journalist"],["Q1231865","pedagogue"],["Q82955","politician"],["Q37226","teacher"],["Q3242115","revolutionary"]],"Field of work":[["Q5891","philosophy"],["Q7163","politics"],["Q8242","literature"],["Q156035","opinion journalism"]],"Influenced by":[["Q76422","Ludwig Feuerbach"]]},"mentions":[],"total":0,"tags":["Type:Person","Nationality:Russian","Nationality:Swiss","Nationality:French","Occupation:Philosopher","Occupation:Writer","Occupation:Journalist","Occupation:Autobiographer","Occupation:Literary critic","Occupation:Prose writer","Occupation:Opinion journalist","Occupation:Pedagogue","Occupation:Politician","Occupation:Teacher","Occupation:Revolutionary","Field:Philosophy","Field:Politics","Field:Literature","Field:Opinion journalism","Century:19th century"]},"Q1541":{"q":"Q1541","label":"Cicero","desc":"Roman statesman, lawyer, orator, and philosopher (106–43 BC)","type":"person","aliases":["M. Tullius Cicero","Marcus Tullius Cicero","Tully","M. Tullii Ciceronis"],"wiki":"Cicero","img":"Bust of Cicero (1st-cent. BC) - Palazzo Nuovo - Musei Capitolini - Rome 2016.jpg","summary":"Marcus Tullius Cicero was a Roman statesman, lawyer, scholar, philosopher, orator, and writer who tried to uphold optimate principles during the political crises of the Roman Republic that led to the establishment of the Roman Empire. The extensive writings of Cicero include treatises on rhetoric, philosophy, and politics. He is considered one of Rome's greatest orators and prose stylists and the innovator of what became known as \"Ciceronian rhetoric\". Cicero was educated in Rome and in Greece.","facts":{"born":"-0106-01-0","died":"-0043-12-0"},"rel":{"Citizenship":[["Q1747689","Ancient Rome"]],"Movement":[["Q3345153","academic skepticism"]],"Occupation":[["Q4964182","philosopher"],["Q49757","poet"],["Q15994177","political theorist"],["Q185351","jurist"],["Q36180","writer"],["Q3409374","ancient Roman priest"],["Q82955","politician"],["Q47064","military personnel"],["Q40348","lawyer"],["Q12859263","orator"]],"Field of work":[["Q5891","philosophy"],["Q81009","rhetoric"],["Q8242","literature"],["Q7163","politics"]],"Positions held":[["Q189430","quaestor"],["Q1836189","plebeian aedile"],["Q172907","praetors"],["Q20056508","ancient Roman senator"],["Q40779","Roman consul"],["Q215909","augur"],["Q1190123","Roman governor"]]},"mentions":[],"total":0,"tags":["Type:Person","Nationality:Roman","Occupation:Philosopher","Occupation:Poet","Occupation:Political theorist","Occupation:Jurist","Occupation:Writer","Occupation:Ancient Roman priest","Occupation:Politician","Occupation:Military personnel","Occupation:Lawyer","Occupation:Orator","Field:Philosophy","Field:Rhetoric","Field:Literature","Field:Politics","Movement:Academic skepticism","Position held:Quaestor","Position held:Plebeian aedile","Position held:Praetors","Position held:Ancient Roman senator","Position held:Roman consul","Position held:Augur","Position held:Roman governor","Century:2nd century BC"]}}